        "text": "When an Item declares Field metadata with input or output processors, those processors are attached to the field definition."
      },
      {
        "id": "B002",
        "text": "When ItemLoader.add_value runs input processors and load_item runs output processors, the resulting item values reflect the processor pipeline."
      },
      {
        "id": "B003",
        "text": "When a nested ItemLoader is created with parent=..., it inherits the parent default processor types."
      },
